<https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2736-7817> a foaf:Person ;
    foaf:name "Pedro Paulo F. Barcelos" .

hri:anatomicalLocationCovered a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "anatomical location covered"@en ;
    skos:definition "Relates a dataset to a SNOMED CT concept identifying an anatomical structure covered by the dataset as a whole at metadata or catalogue level."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Values must be concept IRIs from the SNOMED CT Anatomical structure hierarchy: 91723000 |Anatomical structure (body structure)| or its descendants (ECL: << 91723000). The root concept IRI is http://snomed.info/id/91723000. The formal RDF range is skos:Concept; the accompanying SHACL shape checks the terminology binding using supplied rdfs:subClassOf paths. Using the anatomical class itself as rdfs:range would instead entail anatomical-instance typing of concept values."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Describes aggregate anatomical coverage of the dataset. Multiple values may be supplied; use is optional (0..*). Values do not identify individual organs, patients, samples, or observations. For a dataset combining data categories or modalities, this property does not pair a particular anatomical location with a particular category, modality, or record. Values follow the Health-RI skos:Concept metadata convention, including when the same IRI denotes a class in SNOMED CT's OWL representation. No new anatomical class is introduced."@en ;
    skos:historyNote "Introduced for R-U-03, Anatomical location covered. The decision to use a Health-RI property with SNOMED CT anatomical-structure concepts supersedes the earlier proposal to use eucaim:hasBodySite with range eucaim:BP1000024. No equivalence, subproperty relationship, or formal mapping to EUCAIM is asserted."@en ;
    skos:example "A dataset covering the lung may link to http://snomed.info/id/39607008 (Lung structure). In metadata the value is typed as skos:Concept; terminology evidence establishes its subsumption under http://snomed.info/id/91723000."@en ;
    rdfs:domain dcat:Dataset ;
    rdfs:range skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <http://snomed.info/id/91723000>,
        <https://docs.snomed.org/snomed-ct-specifications/snomed-ct-editorial-guide/readme/authoring/domain-specific-modeling/body-structure/body-structure-attributes-summary> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/health-ri/metadata-vocabulary> .
